## Memory Data Model (Minimal)
Relationships:
- `task` (1) -> (N) `run`
- `run` (1) -> (N) `run_event` (append-only)
- `run` (N) <-> (N) `library_item` via `run_library_link` (Used/Created/Promoted/Superseded)
- `library_item.superseded_by_id` links to a newer version (never delete; supersede)

### Tables (Existing in Render Postgres)
These tables were created directly in the Render Postgres database (not via Alembic yet).

`task`
- id: uuid (no DB default; app must generate)
- title: text
- workflow_key: text
- goal: text
- acceptance_criteria: text
- systems_touched: jsonb default `{}`
- risk_level: text default `read_only`
- status: text default `open`
- created_at: timestamptz default `now()`
- last_touched_at: timestamptz default `now()`

`run`
- id: uuid (no DB default)
- task_id: uuid
- targets: jsonb default `[]`
- started_at: timestamptz default `now()`
- ended_at: timestamptz nullable
- status: text default `aborted`
- summary: text

`run_event` (append-only)
- id: bigint identity via `run_event_id_seq`
- run_id: uuid
- ts: timestamptz default `now()`
- type: text (`note|cmd|sql|error|breakthrough|link`)
- message: text
- data: jsonb default `{}`
- supersedes_event_id: bigint nullable

`library_item`
- id: uuid (no DB default)
- workflow_key: text
- kind: text (`recipe|pitfall|decision|checklist`)
- title: text
- body_mdc: text
- tags: jsonb default `{}`
- source_refs: jsonb default `[]`
- created_at: timestamptz default `now()`
- last_used_at: timestamptz nullable
- promotion_mode: text default `auto` (`auto|user`)
- superseded_by_id: uuid nullable

`run_library_link`
- run_id: uuid
- library_item_id: uuid
- relation: text (`used|created|promoted|superseded`)
- created_at: timestamptz default `now()`

